{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27925","headline":"送唐中丞开淘西湖夏日游泛因书示郡人 · 朱庆余","name":"送唐中丞开淘西湖夏日游泛因书示郡人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萍岸新淘见碧霄，中流相去忽成遥。\n空余孤屿来诗景，无复横槎碍柳条。\n红斾路幽山翠湿，锦帆风起浪花飘。\n共知浸润同雷泽，何虑川源有旱苗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}